    "type": "game",
    "name": "ANNIHILATOR",
    "steam_appid": 3645860,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/extras/0d487ca8756b8fa5f8770ee37eced35e.avif?t=1744263714\" width=800 height=632 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 40XX. Eden Try: a city powered by pain. Buildings, lights, street signs, vending machines\u2014all run on the agony of those unfortunate to endure Tribulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/extras/7300b44ae703edc7b2f19cf5d159e2ed.avif?t=1744263714\" width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pioneered by CRUSH, Tribulation transforms human suffering into fuel for war machines and enhanced soldiers. Victims\u2019 torsos, vital organs, and brains are fused with machines designed to extract raw emotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/extras/c72b0d267b9c1f13b37b8777ff826102.avif?t=1744263714\" width=800 height=632 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locked in a perpetual loop of death and revival, they relive their final moments endlessly. Fear, hate, hope\u2014all harvested through torture to power the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But by miracle or chance, One has escaped hell and death followed him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/extras/58d4b0de642c07db42a450b22b57b82d.avif?t=1744263714\" width=800 height=632 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Shinryu, after regaining consciousness. Taken as a trophy and placed in an Annihilator suit, forced to do the bidding of a psychopath CEO. You seek revenge for the pain caused to your family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/extras/f44dcd5c667609b91e0ab0b99821e5a4.avif?t=1744263714\" width=800 height=800 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Origin</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/extras/0d4bb48733aa54e67b60a6785748c79b.avif?t=1744263714\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Annihilator is a gritty top-down shooter, originally made for the Game Boy Color. This is a modern 1:1 adaption, where I've converted the original GBC graphics into a 3D environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's design is based around the original limitations with tweaks to make it feel better for modern play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You'll fight your way through various facilities - facing cyborgs and mutants to take down a corporate war machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/extras/92abe3a41f03f1aec3c8d2afe8ab6bf6.avif?t=1744263714\" width=800 height=632 /></span><br></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/extras/0d487ca8756b8fa5f8770ee37eced35e.avif?t=1744263714\" width=800 height=632 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 40XX. Eden Try: a city powered by pain. Buildings, lights, street signs, vending machines\u2014all run on the agony of those unfortunate to endure Tribulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/extras/7300b44ae703edc7b2f19cf5d159e2ed.avif?t=1744263714\" width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pioneered by CRUSH, Tribulation transforms human suffering into fuel for war machines and enhanced soldiers. Victims\u2019 torsos, vital organs, and brains are fused with machines designed to extract raw emotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/extras/c72b0d267b9c1f13b37b8777ff826102.avif?t=1744263714\" width=800 height=632 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locked in a perpetual loop of death and revival, they relive their final moments endlessly. Fear, hate, hope\u2014all harvested through torture to power the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But by miracle or chance, One has escaped hell and death followed him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/extras/58d4b0de642c07db42a450b22b57b82d.avif?t=1744263714\" width=800 height=632 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Shinryu, after regaining consciousness. Taken as a trophy and placed in an Annihilator suit, forced to do the bidding of a psychopath CEO. You seek revenge for the pain caused to your family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/extras/f44dcd5c667609b91e0ab0b99821e5a4.avif?t=1744263714\" width=800 height=800 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Origin</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/extras/0d4bb48733aa54e67b60a6785748c79b.avif?t=1744263714\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Annihilator is a gritty top-down shooter, originally made for the Game Boy Color. This is a modern 1:1 adaption, where I've converted the original GBC graphics into a 3D environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's design is based around the original limitations with tweaks to make it feel better for modern play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You'll fight your way through various facilities - facing cyborgs and mutants to take down a corporate war machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645860/extras/92abe3a41f03f1aec3c8d2afe8ab6bf6.avif?t=1744263714\" width=800 height=632 /></span><br></p>",
